== 1.7 Chapter 1 Practice Drill — 40 Questions

40 questions graded in the order the CBT engine is likely to meet them. Allow 44 minutes; the key and a full solution for every question follow.

#mcq(1, [The word *courage* in the sentence “Courage is a rare quality” is],
  [an adjective],
  [a collective noun],
  [an abstract noun],
  [a common noun]
)

#mcq(2, [Which of the following is NOT an adverb?],
  [friendly],
  [hardly],
  [well],
  [quickly]
)

#mcq(3, [In the sentence “She has written three letters”, the word *written* is],
  [the past participle],
  [the base form],
  [the past tense],
  [the present participle]
)

#mcq(4, [The plural of *criterion* is],
  [criterias],
  [criterion],
  [criteria],
  [criterions]
)

#mcq(5, [Complete the sentence: “The teacher gave us some useful \_\_\_.”],
  [advise],
  [advices],
  [advice],
  [advises]
)

#mcq(6, [The plural of *phenomenon* is],
  [phenomenae],
  [phenomenon],
  [phenomenons],
  [phenomena]
)

